Suggests: kstars
Description: INDI driver for the Vixen Wireless Unit
 This package provides an INDI telescope driver for the Vixen Wireless Unit
 used with Vixen mounts such as the SXP2. It communicates with Wireless Unit
 firmware 2.60 over UDP and supports GoTo, tracking, parking, pulse guiding,
 alignment management, mount settings, and Wi-Fi configuration.
